OL,3,GNEWSANew town centre police station
OL,4,Aapproved by planners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority has approved plans
OL,7,Ffor a new police station in a former
OL,8,Fdinosaur-themed restaurant.
OL,10,FNorth Northamptonshire Council has
OL,11,Fapproved Northamptonshire Police's
OL,12,Fplans to adapt the former Jurassic
OL,13,FGrill in Market Place, Kettering.
OL,15,FIt would replace the force's existing
OL,16,Fbase in the council's car park on
OL,17,FBowling Green Road.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
