OL,3,GNEWSANew town centre police station
OL,4,Aapproved by planners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe office of Northamptonshire's
OL,7,Fpolice, fire and crime commissioner,
OL,8,FDanielle Stone, previously said the new
OL,9,Ffacility would "create a new, visible
OL,10,Fand accessible police station in the
OL,11,Fcentre of the town".
